## 📂 Dataset Source

The dataset used in this project was downloaded from the following Kaggle dataset:

**Kaggle Dataset:**
Tata Motors Sales Analysis
(https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/numenvikrant/tata-motors-sales-analysis-2021-2022?utm_source=chatgpt.com)

The downloaded dataset was used as the **source data** for this project. It was loaded into SQL Server, cleaned, standardized, validated, and transformed into analysis-ready tables (`sales_details` and `vehicle_info`) for sales analysis and Power BI dashboard development.

